1565
01:05:34.890 --> 01:05:38.150
So if you had your slippers on, it said slow down.

1566
01:05:38.150 --> 01:05:41.360
And that was one of my ideas for this hotel

1567
01:05:41.360 --> 01:05:43.760
that was supposed to be almost like a spa hotel

1568
01:05:43.760 --> 01:05:45.470
in the financial district.

1569
01:05:45.470 --> 01:05:47.010
Slow down.

1570
01:05:47.010 --> 01:05:51.420
So I was in my own NDE that was just telling me

1571
01:05:51.420 --> 01:05:52.280
