1572
01:05:52.280 --> 01:05:53.810
That is the experience I had.

1573
01:05:53.810 --> 01:05:55.540
That's what I take from it.

1574
01:05:55.540 --> 01:05:56.373
The other thing I take.

1575
01:05:56.373 --> 01:06:01.373
Because again, the dripping of the oil was so slow.

1576
01:06:01.580 --> 01:06:04.500
So I might be out for two minutes or three minutes

1577
01:06:04.500 --> 01:06:05.700
