1579
01:06:07.160 --> 01:06:08.453
for hours or days.

1580
01:06:09.870 --> 01:06:12.160
But more than anything what I got from it,

1581
01:06:12.160 --> 01:06:17.100
was just this deep sense of just slowing down.

1582
01:06:17.100 --> 01:06:18.260
And when I slowed down,

1583
01:06:18.260 --> 01:06:20.780
I realized that I'd spent my life running away

1584
01:06:20.780 --> 01:06:21.853
