1593
01:06:45.590 --> 01:06:47.739
I was no longer meditating.

1594
01:06:47.739 --> 01:06:49.350
And so my exercise,

1595
01:06:49.350 --> 01:06:52.400
I started practicing my meditation every morning

1596
01:06:52.400 --> 01:06:53.750
