01:07:23.920 --> 01:07:28.920
So what I noticed was that when I slowed down,

1612
01:07:31.020 --> 01:07:35.370
my ego started to melt and Richard Warren,

1613
01:07:35.370 --> 01:07:38.120
Carl Jung had both said that your primary operating system

1614
01:07:38.120 --> 01:07:41.380
